-s2.0-3843083957</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15302640</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kasper</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Konstantinides</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Geibel</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Tiede</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Krause</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Just</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognostic significance of right ventricular afterload stress detected by echocardiography in patients with clinically suspected pulmonary embolism</article-title><source><italic>Heart</italic></source><year>1997</year><volume>77</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>346</fpage><lpage>349</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-0031001508</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9155614</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gibson</surname><given-names>NS</given-names></name><name><surname>Sohne</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Buller</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognostic value of echocardiography and spiral computed tomography in patients with pulmonary embolism</article-title><source><italic>Current Opinion in Pulmonary Medicine</italic></source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>380</fpage><lpage>384</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-24744434161</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16093809</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><fig id="fig1" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>M-mode on IVC showing normal IVC collapse on respiration.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.EM2013-312632.001"/></fig><fig id="fig2" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Apical four-chamber view showing normal RV&#x02009;:&#x02009;LV ratio.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.EM2013-312632.002"/></fig></floats-group></article>